//RS /// Load + check a fixture on the canonical compiler worker.
//RS ///
//RS /// `Loader::load_entry` and `Sema::check_bundle` are the same unbounded-depth
//RS /// recursive descent every compile entry runs, and reaching them directly --
//RS /// as this helper does, and as any embedder holding its own bundle would --
//RS /// skips the driver's own boundary. Without it a 2 MiB libtest worker aborts
//RS /// the whole binary and reports every other in-flight test as failed.
